# Prevent large client/mobile assets and local secrets entering the Docker build context.
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*adminsdk*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
client/public
client/android
client/ios
client/tests
client/scripts
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.glb
